OL,3,ABadenoch accuses Burnham of kicking
OL,4,Adefence spending into the long grass
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far Andy Burnham's government has
OL,7,Fonly committed to setting out a plan in
OL,8,Fthe spring to meet the Nato target of
OL,9,Fspending 3.5% of GDP on defence by
OL,10,F2035.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
